{
  "_readme": [
    "Every query below is taken verbatim from the CADI Google Analytics site-search",
    "export (7 Feb - 7 Apr 2026), including the misspellings. Expectations are set",
    "against pages that actually exist on cadi.port.ac.uk.",
    "",
    "Assertion types:",
    "  expect_url_contains  the top result's URL must contain this string",
    "  expect_in_top_3      one of the top three results must contain this string",
    "  expect_weak          retrieval must report low confidence (nothing really answers this)",
    "  expect_gap           retrieval must find nothing at all",
    "",
    "The expect_weak and expect_gap cases matter more than the score suggests.",
    "They assert that certain questions return an honest 'not on this site'. Any",
    "later tuning for recall will quietly destroy that unless it is tested."
  ],
